{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "MRK",
  "chapter": 8,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In those days the multitude being very great, and having nothing to eat, Jesus called his disciples ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "unto him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and saith unto them,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have compassion on the multitude, because they have now been with me three days, and have nothing to eat:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if I send them away fasting to their own houses, they will faint by the way: for divers of them came from far.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And his disciples answered him, From whence can a man satisfy these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with bread here in the wilderness?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he asked them, How many loaves have ye? And they said, Seven.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he commanded the people to sit down on the ground: and he took the seven loaves, and gave thanks, and brake, and gave to his disciples to set before ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; and they did set ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before the people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they had a few small fishes: and he blessed, and commanded to set them also before ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So they did eat, and were filled: and they took up of the broken ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "meat",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that was left seven baskets.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they that had eaten were about four thousand: and he sent them away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ And straightway he entered into a ship with his disciples, and came into the parts of Dalmanutha.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the Pharisees came forth, and began to question with him, seeking of him a sign from heaven, tempting him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he sighed deeply in his spirit, and saith, Why doth this generation seek after a sign? verily I say unto you, There shall no sign be given unto this generation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he left them, and entering into the ship again departed to the other side.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ Now ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the disciples",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " had forgotten to take bread, neither had they in the ship with them more than one loaf.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he charged them, saying, Take heed, beware of the leaven of the Pharisees, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the leaven of Herod.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they reasoned among themselves, saying, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " because we have no bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when Jesus knew ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", he saith unto them, Why reason ye, because ye have no bread? perceive ye not yet, neither understand? have ye your heart yet hardened?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Having eyes, see ye not? and having ears, hear ye not? and do ye not remember?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I brake the five loaves among five thousand, how many baskets full of fragments took ye up? They say unto him, Twelve.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when the seven among four thousand, how many baskets full of fragments took ye up? And they said, Seven.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said unto them, How is it that ye do not understand?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ And he cometh to Bethsaida; and they bring a blind man unto him, and besought him to touch him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he took the blind man by the hand, and led him out of the town; and when he had spit on his eyes, and put his hands upon him, he asked him if he saw ought.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he looked up, and said, I see men as trees, walking.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "After that he put ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hands again upon his eyes, and made him look up: and he was restored, and saw every man clearly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he sent him away to his house, saying, Neither go into the town, nor tell ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to any in the town.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ And Jesus went out, and his disciples, into the towns of Cæsarea Philippi: and by the way he asked his disciples, saying unto them, Whom do men say that I am?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they answered, John the Baptist: but some ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "say",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Elias; and others, One of the prophets.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he saith unto them, But whom say ye that I am? And Peter answereth and saith unto him, Thou art the Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he charged them that they should tell no man of him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he began to teach them, that the Son of man must suffer many things, and be rejected of the elders, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the chief priests, and scribes, and be killed, and after three days rise again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he spake that saying openly. And Peter took him, and began to rebuke him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But when he had turned about and looked on his disciples, he rebuked Peter, saying, Get thee behind me, Satan: for thou savourest not the things that be of God, but the things that be of men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ And when he had called the people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "unto him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with his disciples also, he said unto them, Whosoever will come after me, let him deny himself, and take up his cross, and follow me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For whosoever will save his life shall lose it; but whosoever shall lose his life for my sake and the gospel’s, the same shall save it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For what shall it profit a man, if he shall gain the whole world, and lose his own soul?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Or what shall a man give in exchange for his soul?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.8.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MRK.8.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whosoever therefore shall be ashamed of me and of my words in this adulterous and sinful generation; of him also shall the Son of man be ashamed, when he cometh in the glory of his Father with the holy angels.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
